0..76 Comment "// What an inductive-recursive block refuses. The block is one admission, so"
77..150 Comment "// one refused member refuses every member with it: positivity is checked"
151..227 Comment "// across the block, so a family to the left of an arrow in another family\'s"
228..306 Comment "// field refuses the block whole; and a decode a code\'s field holds must stand"
307..380 Comment "// below the code, so a field decoding a code it was not built from, or a"
381..457 Comment "// decoder arm decoding its own code again, refuses the decoder by the stage"
458..530 Comment "// order and its codes with it. A decode reads a call only when the call"
531..549 Comment "// returns a code."
550..614 Comment "// Shared with `../../model/universe/inductive-recursive.gandr`."
